WEBVTT

00:00:18.036 --> 00:00:21.716
SCANNER:
Life reading negative.
Mr. Incredible terminated.

00:00:25.156 --> 00:00:29.436
This project has
completely confiscated
my life, darling.

00:00:29.516 --> 00:00:31.956
Consumed me as only
hero work can.

00:00:32.036 --> 00:00:33.836
My best work,
I must admit.

00:00:34.196 --> 00:00:38.116
Simple, elegant, yet bold.
You will die.

00:00:38.196 --> 00:00:40.116
E, I just...
I did Robert's suit,

00:00:40.196 --> 00:00:43.756
and it turned out
so beautiful,
I had to continue.

00:00:43.836 --> 00:00:47.756
It's great to see you,
but I have no idea what
you're talking about.

00:00:47.836 --> 00:00:49.956
I just...
Yes, words are useless.

00:00:50.036 --> 00:00:52.956
Gobble, gobble, gobble.
Too much of it, darling.
Too much!

00:00:53.036 --> 00:00:55.196
That is why
I show you my work.

00:00:55.396 --> 00:00:56.956
That is why
you are here.

00:01:04.036 --> 00:01:05.836
Edna Mode.

00:01:07.236 --> 00:01:08.556
And guest.

00:01:25.596 --> 00:01:27.196
Come. Sit.

00:01:31.436 --> 00:01:32.996
Cream and sugar?

00:01:33.116 --> 00:01:34.276
Thanks.

00:01:34.556 --> 00:01:36.756
I started with the baby.
Started?

00:01:36.836 --> 00:01:40.836
Shh! Darling!
I cut it a little roomy
for the free movement.

00:01:40.956 --> 00:01:43.836
The fabric is comfortable
for sensitive skin,

00:01:44.556 --> 00:01:48.836
and can also withstand
a temperature of over
1000 degrees.

00:01:51.236 --> 00:01:52.996
Completely bulletproof.

00:01:55.436 --> 00:01:57.956
And machine washable, darling.
That's a new feature.

00:01:58.276 --> 00:02:00.996
What on earth do you think
the baby will be doing?

00:02:01.076 --> 00:02:03.556
Well, I'm sure
I don't know, darling.

00:02:03.636 --> 00:02:05.156
Luck favors
the prepared.

00:02:05.636 --> 00:02:08.476
I didn't know
the baby's powers,
so I covered the basics.

00:02:08.556 --> 00:02:09.956
Jack-Jack doesn't
have any powers.

00:02:10.036 --> 00:02:11.036
No?

00:02:11.116 --> 00:02:12.956
Well, he'll look
fabulous anyway.

00:02:15.116 --> 00:02:19.036
Your boy's suit
I designed to withstand
enormous friction

00:02:19.116 --> 00:02:22.636
without heating up
or wearing out.
A useful feature.

00:02:23.636 --> 00:02:26.076
Your daughter's
suit was tricky.

00:02:26.156 --> 00:02:28.796
I finally created
a sturdy material

00:02:28.876 --> 00:02:31.556
that will disappear
completely as she does.

00:02:35.116 --> 00:02:39.396
Your suit can
stretch as far as you can,
without injuring yourself,

00:02:39.516 --> 00:02:41.636
and still retain
its shape.

00:02:42.396 --> 00:02:44.676
Virtually indestructible,

00:02:45.676 --> 00:02:48.316
yet it breathes
like Egyptian cotton.

00:02:48.676 --> 00:02:52.076
As an extra feature,
each suit contains
a homing device,

00:02:52.156 --> 00:02:55.036
giving you the precise
global location of
the wearer

00:02:55.116 --> 00:02:56.436
at the touch
of a button.

00:02:57.516 --> 00:03:00.516
Well, darling?
What do you think?

00:03:00.636 --> 00:03:05.196
What do I think?
Bob is retired!
I'm retired!

00:03:05.276 --> 00:03:06.756
Our family
is underground.

00:03:06.876 --> 00:03:09.996
You helped my husband
resume secret hero work
behind my back?

00:03:10.076 --> 00:03:12.596
Well, I assumed
you knew, darling.

00:03:12.716 --> 00:03:15.596
Why would he keep
secrets from you?

00:03:15.876 --> 00:03:18.316
He wouldn't.
Didn't. Doesn't.

00:03:18.956 --> 00:03:22.316
Men at Robert's age
are often unstable.

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.716
Prone to weakness.

00:03:24.836 --> 00:03:25.876
What are you saying?

00:03:26.196 --> 00:03:28.476
Do you know
where he is?

00:03:28.556 --> 00:03:29.556
Of course.

00:03:29.676 --> 00:03:31.516
Do you know
where he is?

00:03:55.676 --> 00:03:57.476
(VOICES, STATIC ON RADIO)

00:04:23.996 --> 00:04:25.676
(ELECTRIC FIZZLING)

00:04:34.156 --> 00:04:35.356
(GRUNT)

00:04:39.716 --> 00:04:41.116
(VOICE ON RADIO)

00:05:02.956 --> 00:05:05.036
GUARD: Hey, hey.
We got a man down!

00:05:05.156 --> 00:05:06.636
GUARD 2:
Come on, let's go.

00:05:10.396 --> 00:05:12.476
GUARD 2: Are you okay?
What happened?

00:05:14.996 --> 00:05:18.236
(OVER RADIO) Break
surveillance and engage.
Continuing sweep...

00:06:59.756 --> 00:07:00.756
(OVER PHONE) Insuricare.

00:07:00.876 --> 00:07:02.476
Oh, hello.
This is Helen Parr.

00:07:02.556 --> 00:07:04.076
Bob Parr is my husband.

00:07:04.156 --> 00:07:07.396
I was wondering if you
could give me the number of
the hotel he's staying at?

00:07:07.476 --> 00:07:09.596
The number I have
is no good.

00:07:09.676 --> 00:07:11.836
Mr. Parr no longer
works here.

00:07:11.916 --> 00:07:13.036
What do you mean?

00:07:13.116 --> 00:07:15.236
He's on a business trip.
A company retreat.

00:07:15.316 --> 00:07:18.396
My records say
he was terminated
almost two months ago.

